est_capacity:   remaining vehicle capacity\n        demands:         demand of every node (index 0 = depot demand = 0)\n        distance_matrix: pairwise Euclidean distance matrix\n    Returns:\n        Index of the next node to visit, or 0 to return to the depot early.\n    \"\"\"\n    current_node = int(current_node)\n    depot = int(depot)\n    unvisited_nodes = np.asarray(unvisited_nodes, dtype=int)\n\n    if unvisited_nodes.size == 0:\n        return depot\n\n    d_cur = distance_matrix[current_node][unvisited_nodes].astype(float)\n    d_depot = distance_matrix[depot][unvisited_nodes].astype(float)\n    demand = demands[unvisited_nodes].astype(float)\n\n    cap = float(rest_capacity) if rest_capacity > 0.0 else 1.0\n    fill = demand / cap\n\n    alpha = 1.0   # weight on distance from current node\n    beta = 0.3    # weight on distance from depot (reward far nodes)\n    gamma = 0.5   # weight on demand fill bonus\n\n    score = alpha * d_cur - beta * d_depot - gamma * fill\n\n    return int(unvisited_nodes[np.argmin(score)])","code_sha256":"705893d1b22fc93e7dd518248ca1de7c58580475ca08aae5cd751ef615f90880","elapsed_seconds":0.25,"error_code":null,"error_detail":null,"evaluation_id":"2948425b122541d6a11c7d959e802062","generation_parents":[{"algorithm":"This algorithm scores each unvisited feasible customer by the saving obtained from serving it now versus visiting it directly from the depot—combining distance from the current node, depot distance, and a load-filling bonus—and picks the customer with the minimum score to greedily construct routes with better capacity utilization and route closing.","code_sha256":"822363937153bd6b502aa00b7462b6da26c404448ea4948edcac8e225a0d3a07","population_member_indices":[1],"selected_parent_position":0}],"generation_request_ref":"rounds/round_0002/eoh_run/results/exchanges/request_12.json","instance_objectives":[0.09389265565180158,-0.009156073917503024,0.08305418538387449,-0.02065735919189572],"lineage_status":"verified","met